      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LUCKY BAMBINO (1) had been out of the money in recent runs before the latest appearance when he scored by 2.25 metres over 1800m at this track. A nice draw on the front line should ensure a cosy run. This looks a sterner test than last time but he is capable of making it consecutive wins. NEVADA GAMBLER (5) won at Port Pirie two runs ago but couldn't repeat the dose at his latest appearance over 1800m at this track, beaten 5 metres. Has the class to take care of this field. CENTREFOLD STAR (4) has been thereabouts of late and is a great chance to break through. Good effort last time out when she finished fourth at this track over 1800m. LAZIEST (2) is worth some thought despite his last-start seventh over 1800m at this track on August 3.",
